{"title": "War Caster: Opportunity Spell", "pageid": 21508, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/War_Caster:_Opportunity_Spell", "categories": ["Reactions", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:War_Caster_Opportunity_Spell.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/War_Caster_Opportunity_Spell.webp/300px-War_Caster_Opportunity_Spell.webp, /w/images/0/08/War_Caster_Opportunity_Spell.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/War_Caster_Opportunity_Spell.webp/300px-War_Caster_Opportunity_Spell.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/War_Caster_Opportunity_Spell.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>War Caster Opportunity Spell</b> is a Passive feature/Reaction obtained by selecting the <a href=\"/wiki/War_Caster\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"War Caster\">War Caster</a> Feat. Characters with this feature are adept at casting <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Grasp\" title=\"Shocking Grasp\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp/25px-Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp/38px-Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp/50px-Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shocking Grasp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp/25px-Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Grasp\" title=\"Shocking Grasp\">Shocking Grasp</a> at an enemy when they leave melee range. This can be done instead of the usual <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attack</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You can also use a <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a> to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Grasp\" title=\"Shocking Grasp\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp/25px-Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp/38px-Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp/50px-Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shocking Grasp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp/25px-Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Grasp\" title=\"Shocking Grasp\">Shocking Grasp</a> at a target moving out of melee range. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dt> Cost: </dt><dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a></span> </dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/War_Caster\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"War Caster\">War Caster</a>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Far%27aag\" title=\"Far'aag\">Far'aag</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/For%27reth\" title=\"For'reth\">For'reth</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ghush%27ins\" title=\"Ghush'ins\">Ghush'ins</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Golbraith_Stredivas\" title=\"Golbraith Stredivas\">Golbraith Stredivas</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jeera\" title=\"Jeera\">Jeera</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Therezzyn\" title=\"Therezzyn\">Therezzyn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Tska%27an\" title=\"Tska'an\">Tska'an</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Umr%27a%27ac\" title=\"Umr'a'ac\">Umr'a'ac</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wanda_Tullermoor\" title=\"Wanda Tullermoor\">Wanda Tullermoor</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Yy%27rul\" title=\"Yy'rul\">Yy'rul</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zhendila\" title=\"Zhendila\">Zhendila</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This feat does not give the user the regular Shocking Grasp spell if they do not already have it. Nevertheless, they can still cast this version during an attack of opportunity, but not in any other context.</li>\n<li>Unlike the regular spell, this version of Shocking Grasp can be cast even while <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Silenced\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\">Silenced</a>.</li>\n<li>Unlike a regular <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Opportunity Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attack</a>, this feature can be used while under the protection of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary\" title=\"Sanctuary\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/20px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/30px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/40px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/20px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary\" title=\"Sanctuary\">Sanctuary</a>; doing so immediately ends the effect.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This feature is still able to attack targets that have either <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Panache\" title=\"Panache\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Panache_Icon.webp/20px-Panache_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Panache_Icon.webp/30px-Panache_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Panache_Icon.webp/40px-Panache_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Panache\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Panache_Icon.webp/20px-Panache_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a4/Panache_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Panache\" title=\"Panache\">Panache</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fancy_Footwork\" title=\"Fancy Footwork\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Fancy_Footwork_Icon.webp/20px-Fancy_Footwork_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Fancy_Footwork_Icon.webp/30px-Fancy_Footwork_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Fancy_Footwork_Icon.webp/40px-Fancy_Footwork_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fancy Footwork\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Fancy_Footwork_Icon.webp/20px-Fancy_Footwork_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Fancy_Footwork_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fancy_Footwork\" title=\"Fancy Footwork\">Fancy Footwork</a>.</li>\n<li>This feature does not trigger when the user is equipped with only ranged weapons.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195402\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2198/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17422/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8847/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 823/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.018/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1315451/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   50.758      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   50.758      1 -total\n 35.49%   18.012      7 Template:Icon_link\n 34.06%   17.287      7 Template:Icon_text\n 29.58%   15.012      1 Template:PageSeo\n 28.84%   14.638      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 28.15%   14.286     14 Template:Trim\n 21.96%   11.147      2 Template:SAI\n 17.05%    8.656      7 Template:Ifempty\n 16.97%    8.616      4 Template:SmSAI\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:21508-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195402 and revision id 395042. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}